    "text": "Let X be a regular algebraic variety over a field of arbitrary characteristic,\nand G a finite cyclic group of automorphisms of X. Suppose that the fixed point\nvariety X G of G is a regular hypersurface of X (of codimension 1). Is the quotient\nvariety X/G regular?                                               K. N. Ponomarëv",
